==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*3 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*2 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 40~43.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,300f</sup>.
*3 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*3 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[H. Nah]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Wild Doge]]s spawn, delay 36.67~43.33 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,300f</sup>.
**5 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
**1 [[Aku Gory]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Even if the Relic Doge may seem intimidating, the Aku Gory and the supporting 200% magnified H. Nah are the real problems on this stage. If available, any [[:Category: Anti-Traitless Cats|Anti-Traitless]] ubers or units will make this stage extremely easy, as it leaves you with only Aku Gory and Relic Doge to worry about.

